<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage above 9 bln rand again.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage above 9 bln rand again.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank said the South African money market shortage rose to 9.071 billion rand on Wednesday from 8.974 billion rand on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
